DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/workers/scripts/{script_name}/deployments/{deployment_id}
Delete a Worker Deployment. The latest deployment, which is actively serving traffic, cannot be deleted. All other deployments can be deleted.
Required: account_id (path); script_name (path); deployment_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/workers/scripts/{script_name}/deployments/{deployment_id}
Get information about a Worker Deployment.
Required: account_id (path); script_name (path); deployment_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/workers/scripts/{script_name}
Fetch raw content for a Worker script. Note this is the original script content, not JSON encoded.
Required: account_id (path); script_name (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/workers/scripts/{script_name}/tails/{id}
Deletes a tail from a Worker.
Required: account_id (path); script_name (path); id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/workers/scripts/{script_name}/versions/{version_id}
Retrieves detailed information about a specific version of a Worker script.
Required: account_id (path); script_name (path); version_id (path)
